        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Version 1.4.2]]></title>
        <id>https://Iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/26/version-1-4-2</id>
        <link href="https://Iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/26/version-1-4-2"/>
        <updated>2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Network optimization has been improved, and commands have been added]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Network optimization has been improved, and commands have been added</p>
<!-- -->
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="network-optimization">Network optimization<a href="https://iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/26/version-1-4-2#network-optimization" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Network optimization" title="Direct link to Network optimization" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>The transmission of the <code>WellRested</code> packet has been improved, slightly reducing network traffic</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="new-commands">New commands<a href="https://iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/26/version-1-4-2#new-commands" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to New commands" title="Direct link to New commands" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>Added support for the <code>/midnightthoughts reload</code> command,
which performs a hot reload of the configuration without requiring a server restart</p>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-warning admonition_xJq3 alert alert--warning"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.893 1.5c-.183-.31-.52-.5-.887-.5s-.703.19-.886.5L.138 13.499a.98.98 0 0 0 0 1.001c.193.31.53.501.886.501h13.964c.367 0 .704-.19.877-.5a1.03 1.03 0 0 0 .01-1.002L8.893 1.5zm.133 11.497H6.987v-2.003h2.039v2.003zm0-3.004H6.987V5.987h2.039v4.006z"></path></svg></span>warning</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>This applies only to the config. A full restart is required when modifying custom achievements or slides</p></div></div>]]></content>
